;; Metal prices live in your own ledger, like any other price.
;;
;; GLDTOLA and SLVTOLA are understood out of the box as a price *per tola*.
;; Any other symbol can be declared via the `metal_commodities` option --
;; see main.beancount.
;;
;; A day with no price of its own reuses the last known price, so you only need
;; a directive when the price actually moves.

